# lazarus — Lazarus Mail Client

## Identity
- **Name**: Lazarus — a fork of [Dodo](https://github.com/akissinger/dodo) by Aleks Kissinger
- **Package**: `lazarus-mail` (`0.3`)
- **Original Author**: Aleks Kissinger <aleks0@gmail.com>
- **Fork Maintainer**: Ruly Tafzil
- **License**: GPLv3 (`COPYING`)
- **Local dir**: `~/Projects/lazarus`
- **Forgejo**: `ssh://forgejo@forge.rulytafzil.com:2222/Home/lazarus.git` (branch `master`)
- **Upstream**: `https://github.com/akissinger/dodo.git` (remote `upstream`, not tracked)
- **CLI**: `lazarus` (`lazarus --install-desktop` installs desktop entry + icons)
- **Entry point**: `lazarus.app:main` (`lazarus/__main__.py` → `app.main()`)
- **Config**: `~/.config/lazarus/config.py` (loaded via `lazarus.config.load_config()` — exec + typed validation; see `lazarus/config.py`)
- **State**: `QSettings('lazarus','lazarus')` — geometry, splitter, open searches
- **Install**: `pipx install -e ~/Projects/lazarus` (editable)

## What It Is
A graphical, keyboard-driven email client in Python/PyQt6 built on the
[notmuch](https://notmuchmail.org/) indexer. Vim-like keychords, split-pane
layout with a persistent thread preview, and a built-in rich-text compose
editor. All operations go through notmuch tags + Maildir file moves — no mail
is ever deleted outright.

Diverged from upstream Dodo: persistent preview, async bulk tag/trash/archive
worker, mail filter rules, built-in `RichTextEditor`, address autocomplete,
per-account signatures, parallel mbsync, hicolor icons.

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Tech | Notes |
|-------|------|-------|
| Language | Python 3.10+ (declared `>=3.7` in `setup.py`) | `from __future__ import annotations` throughout |
| GUI | PyQt6 `>=6.2`, PyQt6-WebEngine `>=6.2` | `QApplication`/`QMainWindow`/`QSplitter`/`QTreeView`/`QWebEngineView`/`QTabWidget`/`QStackedWidget` |
| Type checking | mypy `disallow_untyped_defs = True` (`mypy.ini`) | |
| HTML | `bleach >=5.0`, `w3m` | `w3m` renders HTML→plaintext; bleach sanitizes |
| Email index | `notmuch` CLI | Wrapped by `lazarus/notmuch.py`; `post-new` hook maps folders→tags |
| IMAP sync | `mbsync` (default) or `offlineimap` | `SyncMailThread` runs `mbsync -V <acct>` in parallel |
| SMTP send | `msmtp` | `msmtp -a "{account}" -t`; per-account via `send_mail_command` dict |
| PGP | `python-gnupg` (optional) | `lazarus/pgp_util.py`; `gnupg_home`/`gnupg_keyid` settings |
| Editor | `$EDITOR` via `editor_command` | External escape hatch (`EditorThread`), default `xterm -e vim {file}` |
| File browser | `file_browser_command` / `file_picker_command` | Attachments / file picker |
| Build | `setuptools >=42` | `setup.py` + `pyproject.toml`; `share/` + `package_data` for icons |
| Logging | stdlib `logging` | Level/file from `settings.log_level`/`log_file`; status bar mirror |

