## Architecture

### Split-Pane Layout
```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ MainWindow (QSplitter — orientation from thread_pane_position) │
│ ┌──────────────────────┐ ┌─────────────────────────────┐ │
│ │ QTabWidget           │ │ QStackedWidget (preview)    │ │
│ │  ├─ SearchPanel      │ │  ├─ ThreadPanel             │ │
│ │  ├─ ComposePanel     │ │  └─ QLabel placeholder      │ │
│ │  └─ TagPanel         │ │     "Select a thread…"      │ │
│ └──────────────────────┘ └─────────────────────────────┘ │
│ CommandBar (centered modal overlay, grow-to-content) / StatusBar │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```
- Preview always visible; `thread_pane_position` = `right`/`left`/`below`/`above` controls `QSplitter` orientation + widget order (`_position_to_orientation`).
- `Enter` on a thread → `SearchPanel.open_current_thread()` → `MainWindow.show_thread()` (no thread tabs).
- `Escape` in preview → `MainWindow.focus_list()`; `C-Enter` → `clear_thread()`.
- `h`/`l` switch `QTabWidget` tabs; `j`/`k` move thread cursor; `J`/`K` move message cursor in preview.
- `j`/`k` auto-opens selected thread after 150 ms debounce (`Panel` timer).
- `QSettings` persists `main_window_geometry`, `main_window_splitter`, `open_searches` (restored at startup).

### Class Hierarchy
```
QApplication
 └── Dodo (app.py) — bootstrap (~390L): config+logging, signals, HelpWindow, delegation shims
      └── controller.AppController (QObject) — panel registry + SyncMailThread/engine; Panels receive `AppController` at runtime. Cycle broken at runtime: app.py imports search/thread only under TYPE_CHECKING; BulkMoveWorker has shutdown sentinel wired to aboutToQuit.

QMainWindow
 └── MainWindow (mainwindow.py)
      ├── QSplitter ──┬── QTabWidget (list tabs: SearchPanel/ComposePanel/TagPanel)
      │               └── QStackedWidget (thread preview + placeholder QLabel)
      ├── CommandBar (commandbar.py — QPlainTextEdit, modal overlay)
      ├── StatusBar (QLabel, auto-hide timer, kind info/error)
      └── Window icon (QIcon.fromTheme('lazarus') → bundled 1024 PNG fallback)

Panel(QWidget) — base for all views (panel.py, has_refreshed signal)
 ├── SearchPanel (search.py)    — SearchModel + QTreeView (5 cols: date/#, from, subject, tags); MarkableActionsMixin
 ├── ThreadPanel (thread.py)    — ThreadModel + QTreeView (message list) + double-buffered QWebEngineView
 ├── ComposePanel (compose.py)  — RichTextEditor + headers + attachments + PGP + account switch + sig
 └── TagPanel (tag.py)          — TagModel + QTreeView (tag browser with unread/total)

Models (QAbstractItemModel):
 ├── SearchModel — wraps notmuch search --format=json (thread dicts)
 ├── ThreadModel — wraps notmuch show --format=json, ThreadItem tree, conversation vs thread mode
 └── TagModel    — wraps notmuch search --output=tags with unread/total counts

Helpers:
 ├── RichTextEditor(QTextEdit) — inline image temp dir, insert_image_from_file/data, body_html/text, collect_inline_images
 ├── AddressCompleter(QCompleter) — notmuch address preload in _AddressLoader thread, MatchContains
 ├── MessagePage/Handler, EmbeddedImageHandler, RemoteBlockingUrlRequestInterceptor (webengine.py)
 ├── EditorThread / SendmailThread (compose_threads.py — QThreads)
 └── _BulkMoveWorker(QThread) + MarkableActionsMixin (actions.py)
```

### Data Flow
```
Search:   notmuch search --format=json → notmuch.search_json() → SearchModel → QTreeView (render_thread_cell, 5 cols)
Thread:   notmuch show --format=json   → ThreadModel (ThreadItem tree) → QTreeView + QWebEngineView (MessagePage, double-buffered)
Compose:  headers + RichTextEditor.body_html/text + attachments + inline images
            → ComposeData (mime_builder) → build_message() → multipart/related MIME
            → SendmailThread → msmtp (send_mail_command) → mailbox save to sent_dir → status bar
Sync:     settings.smtp_accounts → SyncMailThread (controller.py: parallel mbsync -V + notmuch new)
            → .progress (pyqtSignal) → MainWindow.status_label → notmuch new (Processed) → controller.refresh_panels() [Dodo shims]
            → rules.apply_rules(filter_rules, filter_scope_query) (auto after sync; C-r manual)
            → [move_to rules via move_files → _BulkMoveWorker]
Tag/Move: MarkableActionsMixin.tag_thread/toggle/archive/delete → notmuch.tag() → collect_files() → _resolve_stale_path()
            → _BulkMoveWorker.enqueue([(src,dst)]) (serial QThread) → move_to_trash/archive/expunge/restore
            → _run_notmuch_new() → has_refreshed → refresh_panels() (keeps preview open)
Delete:   d → +trash tag + move files to [Gmail]/Trash or [account]/Trash → refresh; d d → expunge_trash() (irreversible)
Archive:  a → -inbox -unread (+ optional tag ops); A → archive_to_local → move to ~/Mail/Archive (mail_root/archive_dir)
```

